      "text": "While you can share a document using the Systems Manager [[p0]] operation, we recommend using Resource Access Manager (RAM) instead. Using [[p1]] requires an extra step. You must promote the document to a standard RAM Resource Share using the RAM [[p2]] API operation. Otherwise, the Systems Manager [[p3]] API operation won’t return the document when filtering for shared documents. The Amazon Web Services Config [[p4]] API operation also can’t use the document.",
